<title>USA: TABLE - Krantor Corp Q2 net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Krantor Corp Q2 net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>DEAR PARK, N.Y. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter ended June 30</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr	 profit	 $0.09     loss	$14.11</p>
<p> Net	 profit	   102     loss	 2,899</p>
<p> Revs			 1,671		    1,057</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   1,134			205</p>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p> Shr	 profit	 $0.34     loss	 $15.63</p>
<p> Net	 profit	   361     loss	 3,164</p>
<p> Revs			 1,919		    5,837</p>
<p> Avg			  1,058			202</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The net earnings for all periods include all benefits and costs related to discontinuing Krantor Corp's Kosher Distribution business in June 1996.</p>
